<title>NEW ZEALAND: Pacific Dunlop NZ raises NZ$7 mln CP - ANZ.</title>
<headline>Pacific Dunlop NZ raises NZ$7 mln CP - ANZ.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pacific Dunlop Holdings (NZ) Ltd's commercial paper programme raised NZ$7 million, with a 7.24 percent weighted average of bids, lead manager ANZ Banking Group (NZ) Ltd said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
